{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-01-27 12:00:00', 'title': 'HOLLAND AMERICA LINE CELEBRATES NAMING OF ROTTERDAM WITH CEREMONY IN NAMESAKE CITY AND SPECIAL SEVEN-DAY VOYAGE', 'text': "HER ROYAL HIGHNESS PRINCESS MARGRIET OF THE NETHERLANDS TO SERVE AS THE SHIP'S GODMOTHER SEATTLE, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HOLLAND AMERICA LINE 'S NEWEST SHIP ROTTERDAM \xa0IS SET TO GET THE ROYAL TREATMENT AT A NAMING CEREMONY IN ROTTERDAM, THE NETHERLANDS, MAY 30, 2022. HER ROYAL HIGHNESS PRINCESS MARGRIET OF THE NETHERLANDS WILL BE THE SHIP'S GODMOTHER, CARRYING ON A DUTCH ROYAL TRADITION THAT BEGAN IN THE 1920S."}